      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The swarm can occupy the same space as another creature and vice versa. The swarm can move through any opening large enough for a Tiny bat. The swarm can't regain hp or gain temporary hp."
      ]
    },
